{"id":"keymaker","name":"Keymaker","tagline":"Manage SSH keys easily","blurb":"Keymaker allows you to manage your SSH keys without dealing with the command line.","description":"Keymaker allows you to manage your SSH keys without dealing with the command line.\nIt helps you generate new keys, view existing ones, and deploy them to servers with a simple interface.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Generate new SSH keys (Ed25519, RSA, ECDSA)\n\n• View and manage keys in your local directory\n\n• Copy public keys to your clipboard\n\n• Deploy keys to remote servers\n\n• Update key passphrases\n\n• Delete unused keys securely\n\n• Modern interface built for GNOME","developer":"Thiago Fernandes","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/icons/128x128/io.github.tobagin.keysmith.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-1_752x552@1.png","w":965,"h":709},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-2_752x552@1.png","w":965,"h":709},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-3_752x552@1.png","w":965,"h":709},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/tobagin.keysmith/18c731a05df1fb65c843c8e0c743077f/screenshots/image-4_752x552@1.png","w":965,"h":709}],"categories":["Networking","Security"],"tags"